Y'all have a great night.

00:01:40.912 --> 00:01:42.043
I'm going home.

00:01:42.043 --> 00:01:44.793
(crowd cheering)

00:01:45.843 --> 00:01:46.676
- [Kelly] Oh My God.

00:01:46.676 --> 00:01:47.509
(crowd cheering)

00:01:47.509 --> 00:01:49.676
- [Kelly] Just thrusting.

00:01:51.660 --> 00:01:55.360
I'm just, You don't know what
You're doing until they play

00:01:56.395 --> 00:01:58.675
it back. I haven't, I haven't
seen it until just now.

00:01:58.675 --> 00:01:59.550
(crowd laughing)

00:01:59.550 --> 00:02:03.360
- [Kelly] And it's a lot of
thrusting. For the life of me,

00:02:03.360 --> 00:02:08.360
I can't figure out why I'm
single. Wow! I'm a lot of person.

00:02:09.210 --> 00:02:12.496
It's awesome. Okay, So at this
point in the show we usually

00:02:12.496 --> 00:02:15.225
give our guests a thousand
dollars courtesy of our season

00:02:15.225 --> 00:02:18.870
long partner, Pilot Pin. Makers
of G-2, the go-to pin of the

00:02:18.870 --> 00:02:22.170
Kelly Clarkson show, but today
we are donating that money to

00:02:22.170 --> 00:02:25.025
an organization, not just
close to Jason's heart but all

00:02:25.025 --> 00:02:28.170
of ours. Jason's daughter
Kennedy was diagnosed with Cancer

00:02:28.170 --> 00:02:30.686
as a teenager. After a very
difficult battle, she's Cancer

00:02:30.686 --> 00:02:31.725
free.

00:02:31.725 --> 00:02:32.995
(crowd cheering)

00:02:32.995 --> 00:02:35.315
- [Kelly] And now, She's
dedicated to helping other kids

00:02:35.315 --> 00:02:38.220
facing that challenging
journey by working with the

00:02:38.220 --> 00:02:40.275
Rally Foundation for
Childhood Cancer Research.

00:02:40.275 --> 00:02:43.980
So, thanks to Pilot Pin the
Rally Foundation is getting a

00:02:43.980 --> 00:02:45.577
cheque for a $1,000.

00:02:45.577 --> 00:02:48.060
(crowd cheering)

00:02:48.060 --> 00:02:50.820
- [Kelly] And that's not
all. I'm being told that our

00:02:50.820 --> 00:02:54.360
